--- serialize -- format-agnostic serialization framework.
---
--- This is a trait-abstraction library: the Encoder, Decoder, Serializer,
--- and SerializerRegistry traits live in Rust (plugin-lib-serialize) and
--- are implemented by concrete format crates (json, toml, yaml). There
--- are no callable handl ops here; the .hnl file exists to declare the
--- library's capability surface for the plugin system.
